  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Third Voluntary National Reviews (VNR) for 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is to develop a comprehensive and inclusive Third Voluntary National Review (VNR) that accurately reflects Malaysias progress towards the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), generate lesson-learned helpful in informing future policy and action especially as inputs to upcoming 13th Malaysia Plan. Specifically, the project has four outputs:Output 1: Interim Report and draft main messages for the Third VNR delivered.Output 2: Draft VNR established with key stakeholders consulted.Outp</narrative>
  </description>
